    Create a slideshow with 6 banner with the option of title and subtitle ,also give full customization access for mobile and desktop to adjust font , arrows , navs , colors everything should be customizable  for desktop as well as responsive, slider should be full width, i need to create the same slideshow i am using with 6 slides, the banner should be the hero banner and set on the whole screen it is exceeding for now , also i need to add link on banner, 6 slides should be differnent and have different styling options for each in reards of banner text
